{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>A jubilee it shall be to you.</b> That you too shall be free men, released from the subjugation of the nations — the opposite of what He said: אַתֶּם לֹא שְׁמַעְתֶּם אֵלַי לִקְרֹא דְרוֹר אִישׁ לְאָחִיו, הִנְנִי קֹרֵא לָכֶם דְּרוֹר נְאֻם ה׳ אֶל הַחֶרֶב אֶל הַדֶּבֶר וְאֶל הָרָעָב (Jeremiah 34:17)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:52.335437480Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}